{"seq":4,"slug":"specs-in-practice","title":"Specs In Practice","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"living-specs-and-drift","title":"活规格与防漂移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice/living-specs-and-drift","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"specs-for-humans-and-agents","title":"规格作为人机共享契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice/specs-for-humans-and-agents","wordCount":1822,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"when-not-to-spec","title":"何时不必写规格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice/when-not-to-spec","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲规格在真实工程中的落地与边界:活规格与防漂移——规格写完会和代码越走越远,如何让它保持有效或体面退场,不腐烂成误导;规格作为人机共享的契约——同一份规格同时服务人(对齐与审查)和 AI(实现与验证),是团队协作的共同语言;以及何时不必写规格——规格有成本,平凡改动、探索性原型不值得,把它用在改动面清晰、正确性重要的地方。\n"}